# Example of a BlueWasher protocol as sent in test(protocol=...), in .prog form.
# Generated by interface_service.sim.mock_chris.random_protocol(random.Random(5)):
# prime, then one dispense and 2 spins. Comment lines are stripped before the protocol is
# stored on the BlueWasher (backend.protocol_lines).
prime 20 4 1 1 5
dispense 87 1 4 0 2 0 1 3 5 500 100 1
rackhome
rackwaitready
rotormoveendless -3250 400 300 1000 1
wait 8000
rotorwaitforpos
rackhome
rackwaitready
rotormoveendless 3150 500 800 1000 1
wait 12000
rotorwaitforpos
